## 📖 Overview

**Cognitive Pattern Explorer** is an educational, psychology-inspired self-reflection web application that allows users to understand their thinking tendencies through interactive decision-making activities.

Instead of acting like a personality test, the application encourages thoughtful exploration using engaging scenarios, drag-and-drop exercises, and personalized reflections.

> **Educational Purpose Only**
>
> This application does **not** diagnose or clinically assess mental health. All results are reflective and intended for learning and self-awareness.

---

## ✨ Features

* 🧠 Discover your thinking style through interactive scenarios
* 🎯 Prioritize values with drag-and-drop cards
* 🗺️ Map your decision-making process using an interactive timeline
* 📊 Personalized thinking pattern percentage breakdown
* 📈 Progress tracking across multiple chapters
* 🎨 Calm and modern UI
* 🌙 Calm & Stress Mode selection
* 📱 Fully responsive design
* ♿ Keyboard accessibility support
* 🎞️ Reduced motion support
* 💾 Works completely offline
* 📄 Entire project contained in a single HTML file

